;
; How Rookery indexes one letter by folder and thread in MYRA
; (rookery_rules.h KR4): its folder (0 inbox, 1 drafts, 2 sent, 3 held for
; consent, 4 trash), its thread (the feed id of the letter that began it,
; at most 4294967295, 10 digits), the letter itself (its feed id, or its
; place in a folder of the Hoard), its size in bytes (4 digits: a payload
; is at most 2048) and when it was written, in seconds since 1970 (12
; digits). Rookery asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps them.
^ZXROOKERY(folder:i1, thread:i10, letter:i10) = size:i4! ^ stamp:i12!
